X1        -0.190616   2.595775  -0.073    0.941    
X2         0.876210   0.066107  13.254    0.000 ***
vhat       1.264273   2.602892   0.486    0.627    

Reduced form:
             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(>|t|)    
Z_INTERCEPT  0.026312   0.067061   0.392    0.695    
Z_Z1        -0.000747   0.056446  -0.013    0.989    
Z_Z2         0.047964   0.066355   0.723    0.470    
Z_Z3        -0.021871   0.075532  -0.290    0.772    

Note: robust standard errors

Number of observations: 250 


